<title>AUSTRALIA: Cricket-West Indies score 181 all out v Pakistan.</title>
<headline>Cricket-West Indies score 181 all out v Pakistan.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies scored 181 all out in 47.3 overs against Pakistan in their World Series limited overs match at the Sydney Cricket Ground on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Score - West Indies 181 all out in 47.3 overs (Shivnarine Chanderpaul 72).</p>
